 192:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/micro_allocator.cc **** // Returns a pointer to any buffer associated with the flatbuffer tensor. Can
 193:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/micro_allocator.cc **** // return nullptr if no buffer is found.
